        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 46-630, No-Touch Foot Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Hygienic germ and hands free design foot door pull is made from 304 solid stainless steel. Normally mounted to the bottom of the door. Just slide the foot operated pull onto the door and screw in place. Now the door can opened with your foot, great for any office, hospital, school and restaurant  doors. Packaged with mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-46-630-size.jpg?v=1704354532\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 46 Foot Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHygienic hands free design - Door is pulled opened with your foot.  Great for commercial restroom doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 46-630 Stainless Steel Foot Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Width: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 13 Gauge 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #6 x 5/8\" Sheet Metal Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/46-630.pdf?v=1704262404\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 46-630 Foot Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
